      "44": "A gift for Rose.",
      "46": "If it pleases you, my dear",
      "47": "child, would you record our",
      "48": "future outings? When I'm",
      "49": "old and my mind is fading",
      "50": "I'd like to reminisce all the",
      "51": "times we've spent together",
      "52": "around this fine Kingdom of",
      "53": "mine. Heed the lessons of",
      "54": "our time together and reflect,",
      "55": "for someday you will be",
      "56": "Queen over this great land.",
      "60": "'Lunch by the Lancalliums'",
      "62": "...",
      "64": "Today Father and I had",
      "65": "lunch by the River Hos, we",
      "66": "sat on our favorite bench",
      "67": "and watched as the farmers",
      "68": "tended to their curious",
      "69": "Bologano fruits. We were",
      "70": "joined by a young farmer",
      "71": "called Gric, he gave me a",
      "72": "basket of strawberries and",
      "73": "they're the best I've ever",
      "74": "tasted! I recall he was writing"
    },
