      "46": "ageing for quite some time",
      "47": "before he took leave and",
      "48": "returned to his farm.",
      "50": "The Lancalliums we'd planted",
      "51": "previously were looking a",
      "52": "little wilted but Father",
      "53": "informed me that Gric would",
      "54": "see to them and make sure",
