      "60": "a great wizard once beat",
      "61": "death and this eventually lead",
      "62": "to the residents of Arceuus",
      "63": "being immortal, but they had",
      "64": "to abandon most of what",
      "65": "made them Human to do so.",
      "66": "In the end, is it worth it?",
      "67": "Forever is a long time and",
      "68": "the mind is more fragile than",
