      "44": "The Fisher's Flute",
      "46": "<col=800080>This happened a few weeks",
      "47": "<col=800080>back, I've finally decided to",
      "48": "<col=800080>write it down, perhaps it'll",
      "49": "<col=800080>help.",
      "51": "<col=000000>A favourite locale of ours is",
      "52": "<col=000000>the Fisher's Market at the",
      "53": "<col=000000>crossroads in Piscarilius, the",
      "54": "<col=000000>merchants are lovely and the",
      "55": "<col=000000>music is always enjoyable!",
      "56": "<col=000000>The smell may not be for",
      "57": "<col=000000>everyone, but after a while",
      "58": "<col=000000>you'll forget about it. Being",
      "60": "<col=000000>royalty, it's good practise to",
      "61": "<col=000000>dress down and be somewhat",
      "62": "<col=000000>anonymous as Father believes",
      "63": "<col=000000>it's a good lesson in",
      "64": "<col=000000>understanding the residents,",
      "65": "<col=000000>for both the good traits and",
      "66": "<col=000000>the bad. Today was a bad",
      "67": "<col=000000>day.",
